{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 102,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Hear my prayer, LORD! my cry come to you.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "102:1 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你听我的祷告，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你聽我的禱告，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Don’t hide your face from me in the day of my distress. your ear to me. me quickly in the day when I call.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我在急难的日子，求你向我侧耳；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我在急難的日子，求你向我側耳；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "For my days consume away like smoke. My bones are burned as a torch.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为，我的年日如烟云消灭；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為，我的年日如煙雲消滅；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "My heart is blighted like grass, and withered, for I forget to eat my bread.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的心被伤，如草枯干，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的心被傷，如草枯乾，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "By reason of the voice of my groaning, my bones stick to my skin.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因我唉哼的声音，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因我唉哼的聲音，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "I am like a pelican of the wilderness. I have become as an owl of the waste places.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我如同旷野的鹈鹕；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我如同曠野的鵜鶘；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "I watch, and have become like a sparrow that is alone on the housetop.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我警醒不睡；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我警醒不睡；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "My enemies reproach me all day. Those who are mad at me use my name as a curse.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的仇敌终日辱骂我；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的仇敵終日辱罵我；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "For I have eaten ashes like bread, and mixed my drink with tears,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我吃过炉灰，如同吃饭；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我吃過爐灰，如同吃飯；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "because of your indignation and your wrath; for you have taken me up and thrown me away.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "这都因你的恼恨和忿怒；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "這都因你的惱恨和忿怒；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "My days are like a long shadow. I have withered like grass.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的年日如日影偏斜；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的年日如日影偏斜；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "But you, LORD, will remain forever; your renown endures to all generations.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "惟你—耶和华必存到永远； 也存到万代。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惟你－耶和華必存到永遠； 也存到萬代。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "You will arise and have mercy on Zion, for it is time to have pity on her. the set time has come.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你必起来怜恤，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你必起來憐恤，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "For your servants take pleasure in her stones, and have pity on her dust.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你的仆人原来喜悦她的石头，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你的僕人原來喜悅她的石頭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "So the nations will fear the LORD’s name, the kings of the earth your glory.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "列国要敬畏耶和华的名；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "列國要敬畏耶和華的名；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "For the LORD has built up Zion. He has appeared in his glory.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为耶和华建造了，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為耶和華建造了，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "He has responded to the prayer of the destitute, and has not despised their prayer.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他垂听穷人的祷告，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他垂聽窮人的禱告，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "This will be written for the generation to come. A people which will be created will praise the LORD,",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "102:18 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "这必为后代的人记下，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "這必為後代的人記下，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "for he has looked down from the height of his sanctuary. From heaven, the LORD saw the earth,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为，他从至高的圣所垂看；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為，他從至高的聖所垂看；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "20",
      "en": {
        "text": "to hear the groans of the prisoner, to free those who are condemned to death,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "要垂听被囚之人的叹息，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "要垂聽被囚之人的歎息，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "21",
      "en": {
        "text": "that men may declare the LORD’s name in Zion, and his praise in Jerusalem,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "使人在传扬耶和华的名， 传扬赞美他的话，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "使人在傳揚耶和華的名， 傳揚讚美他的話，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "22",
      "en": {
        "text": "when the peoples are gathered together, the kingdoms, to serve the LORD.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "就是在万民和列国",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "就是在萬民和列國",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "23",
      "en": {
        "text": "He weakened my strength along the course. He shortened my days.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他使我的力量中道衰弱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他使我的力量中道衰弱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "24",
      "en": {
        "text": "I said, “My God, don’t take me away in the middle of my days. Your years are throughout all generations.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我说：我的 神啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我說：我的上帝啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "25",
      "en": {
        "text": "Of old, you laid the foundation of the earth. The heavens are the work of your hands.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你起初立了地的根基；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你起初立了地的根基；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "26",
      "en": {
        "text": "They will perish, but you will endure. all of them will wear out like a garment. You will change them like a cloak, and they will be changed.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "天地都要灭没，你却要长存；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "天地都要滅沒，你卻要長存；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "27",
      "en": {
        "text": "But you are the same. Your years will have no end.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "惟有你永不改变；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惟有你永不改變；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "28",
      "en": {
        "text": "The children of your servants will continue. Their offspring will be established before you.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你仆人的子孙要长存；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你僕人的子孫要長存；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}